{"parse":{"title":"Kolo of Spring's Arrival","pageid":491540,"revid":2189680,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Kolo of Spring&#39;s Arrival</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Kolo_of_Spring%27s_Arrival.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031059\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Constellation Kolo of Spring&#39;s Arrival\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Kolo_of_Spring%27s_Arrival.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031059\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Kolo_of_Spring%27s_Arrival.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031059 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/7b/Constellation_Kolo_of_Spring%27s_Arrival.png/revision/latest?cb=20260928031059 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Constellation Kolo of Spring&#39;s Arrival\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Kolo_of_Spring%27s_Arrival.png\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Kolo of Spring&#39;s Arrival.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"level\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\">Next</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Farewell_Feast\" title=\"Winter&#39;s Farewell Feast\">Winter's Farewell Feast</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"level\"><a href=\"/wiki/Winter%27s_Last_Offering\" title=\"Winter&#39;s Last Offering\">Winter's Last Offering</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDescription\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Ascension Talent <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Rite of Spring's Procession</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Rite of Spring's Procession</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After Vesna uses the special Elemental Skill Windborne Sword or the Elemental Burst For the Tsaritsa!, she also gains 1 stack of Disciplinary Action which lasts 20s. Max 6 stacks, and the duration of each stack is independent of the others'.<br />When she has Disciplinary Action stacks active, the Spirit Blades summoned by Vesna will deal DMG equal to (100% + 10% × Disciplinary Action stack count) of the original DMG instead. All active stacks of Disciplinary Action are cleared when Vesna uses the Elemental Skill The Art of Victory or when she leaves the field.</span></span></span> is enhanced: Vesna gains the maximum number of Disciplinary Action stacks when she enters <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Armed for Action</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Armed for Action</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">Vesna switches to this mode after using the Elemental Skill The Art of Victory. In this mode, which lasts up to 15s:<br /><ul><li>Vesna's resistance to interruption is increased.</li><li>DMG dealt by Vesna with her Normal Attacks, Charged Attacks, and Plunging Attacks becomes <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> that cannot be overridden by another elemental infusion instead. She will also summon a wind pinion that attacks the opponent at the same time, dealing additional <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span>. Each time the wind pinion is summoned, Vesna will regenerate a certain amount of Sword Essence.</li><li>Vesna can consume Sword Essence to unleash the special Elemental Skill Windborne Sword, which deals <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> to her opponents.</li><li>Vesna will exit the mode when its duration ends or after she has used Windborne Sword at the highest level 3 times. Exiting will clear all remaining Sword Essence she has accrued.</li></ul></span></span></span> mode. Vesna's ATK is increased by 40% when she has maximum Disciplinary Action stacks.<br />You must unlock the Ascension Talent \"Rite of Spring's Procession\" to gain access to the above effects.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Kolo of Spring's Arrival</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Vesna\" title=\"Vesna\">Vesna</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Level_2_Constellation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Level 2 Constellation\">Level 2 Constellation</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FKolo_of_Spring%2527s_Arrival%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Kolo of Spring's Arrival</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">迎春的轮舞</span><br /><small><i><span lan